        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: ఖజానా",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ఖజానా — khajānā — \"a treasury\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "రాజు ఖజానా బంగారంతో నిండి ఉండేది. rāju khajānā baṅgārantō niṇḍi uṇḍēdi. The king's treasury used to be full of gold."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Today also the public purse: ప్రభుత్వ ఖజానా (khajānā)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ఖజానా (khajānā) is a loan from Arabic khizāna, \"a storehouse, a treasury\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
